  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/6c3pRzN0/logo-wide.png\"></p><h1><strong>功能特色：</strong></h1><p>解決暮光森林與 Quark 模組中箱子與書架合成配方衝突的問題</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h1><strong>需求模組</strong></h1><ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/the-twilight-forest\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">暮光森林 (The Twilight Forest)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/quark\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Quark 模組</a></li>\n</ul><h1><strong>贊助支持</strong></h1><ul>\n<li><strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252flordddiamond\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://ko-fi.com/lordddiamond</a></strong></li>\n</ul><h1><strong>模組包使用</strong></h1><p>是的，您<strong>可以</strong>將此模組用於您的模組包中！😇</p><p><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/jZjvMbM4/Screen-1.png\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/WW35JDQY/Screen-2.png\"></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwabbanode.com%252faffiliate%252fpiglet\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1404348/description_1eddde9a-fbdb-46c8-b853-20cd883a0110.png\" alt=\"\"></a></p>",
